# Quintessential Katana: only a Ninja you control entering offers the attach (a Savannah Lions, a Blood Artist and the Plains of
# Bot1 offer nothing, and neither does Bot2's own Blade-Blizzard Kitsune), and the granted "untap it and you gain 2 life" is
# for the equipped creature's own combat damage alone. Bot1 equips the Blood Artist (0/1, a 1/2 with the Katana); on T3 only
# the Lions attacks, so Bot1 gains nothing (Bot2 20 - 2 = 18); on T5 the Artist attacks for 1 (damage of any amount more than 0
# triggers it): Bot1 20 + 2 = 22 and Bot2 18 - 1 = 17.

